  "selection": "WPE + nonnegative group-sparse covariance; six taps, delay two, three iterations, FFT256/hop64 on 750ms; spatial FFT1024/hop128, 48 active bins 300-6000Hz, relative floor .0001, 72 circle/642 sphere, ADMM rho1/max100 float32, group penalty .03*sqrt(frequencies), 10deg smoothing/centroid and 30deg final angular suppression. No source-count input or two-source cap. Original compute/response references retained for explicit quality/latency comparison; user permits stable-source utility.",
